# Each SP (SP1, SP2, SP3) must be treated as a separate platform
# until proven compatible.
#
# Expected SP versions:
# - SP1: Based on openEuler 20.03 / CentOS 8.2?
# - SP2: Based on openEuler 22.03?
# - SP3: Based on openEuler 24.03?
#
# Platform IDs will be refined:
#   kylin-v10-sp1-aarch64
#   kylin-v10-sp2-aarch64
#   kylin-v10-sp3-aarch64

# Key questions to resolve:
# - Exact SP and patch version
# - CPU model (Kunpeng 920, Phytium FT-2000, etc.)
# - glibc version
# - GCC version
# - OpenSSL version
# - RPM version
# - yum or dnf?
# - systemd version
# - SELinux default state
# - Default filesystem type
# - Minimal install package set

# Build MUST be native aarch64 — no cross-compilation from x86_64.
# Build host: Kunpeng 920 or Phytium machine with Kylin V10 installed.

